[TestRuleVMAlertCheck/debug_on_a_group - 1]
- description: debug on a group
  content: |
    - name: g
      debug: true
      rules:
      - alert: Down
        expr: up == 0
  output: |
    2 |   debug: true
                 ^^^^
                 `debug: true` makes vmalert log every query of every rule in this group and every change of
                 their alerts' state.
  problem:
    reporter: rule/vmalert
    summary: debug mode enabled
    details: 'With `debug: true` vmalert logs every datasource request of the rule and every alert state change at INFO level, set on a group it applies to all rules of the group. It''s meant for debugging a rule, remove it once you''re done. See [vmalert debug mode](https://docs.victoriametrics.com/victoriametrics/vmalert/#debug-mode).'
    diagnostics:
        - message: '`debug: true` makes vmalert log every query of every rule in this group and every change of their alerts'' state.'
          firstcolumn: 1
          lastcolumn: 4
          kind: 0
    lines:
        first: 2
        last: 2
    severity: 1
    anchor: 0

